  "claim": "As of 2016, the band The Classic Crime have released more albums than The Last Shadow Puppets.",
  "evidencia": "Page: The Last Shadow Puppets. Sentence: Following a lengthy hiatus, they returned, releasing second album \"Everything You've Come to Expect\" in 2016.\nPage: The Classic Crime. Sentence: The Classic Crime is an American rock band from Seattle, Washington formed in 2004.\nPage: The Classic Crime. Sentence: They have released three albums and an EP on Tooth & Nail Records, two of which, \"The Silver Cord\" (2008) and \"Vagabonds\" (2010), charted in the \"Billboard\" 200.\nPage: The Classic Crime. Sentence: In July 2011, the band left Tooth & Nail to produce a fourth album with the help of fan donations via Kickstarter, called \"Phoenix\" (2012).\nPage: The Classic Crime. Sentence: In April 2016, The Classic Crime created a Kickstarter to raise funds for a fifth studio album.",
