        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "7724a3b5-18f3-5c1b-9a98-8a655ac3c67c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: The Last Shadow Puppets, The Classic Crime, Tooth & Nail Records, Kickstarter\n- Places: Seattle, Washington\n- Products: Everything You've Come to Expect, The Silver Cord, Vagabonds, Phoenix\n- Topics: album releases, hiatus, crowdfunding, Billboard 200\n\nFacts:\n- The Classic Crime is an American rock band from Seattle, Washington that formed in 2004.\n- The Classic Crime released three albums and one EP on Tooth & Nail Records.\n- The Classic Crime albums \"The Silver Cord\" in 2008 and \"Vagabonds\" in 2010 charted in the Billboard 200.\n- In July 2011, The Classic Crime left Tooth & Nail Records to produce its fourth album with fan donations through Kickstarter.\n- The Classic Crime released its fourth album, \"Phoenix,\" in 2012.\n- In 2016, following a lengthy hiatus, The Last Shadow Puppets returned and released their second album, \"Everything You've Come to Expect.\"\n- In April 2016, The Classic Crime created a Kickstarter campaign to raise funds for a fifth studio album.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
